# ADR-0033: freeze frames don't age p1's input. Testman's 5a hits on frame 5; the red Roman Cancel on frame 6 freezes
# the match for 6 frames (6-11). 5b pressed on frame 8 is still buffered when p1 runs again and comes out on frame
# 12, though 4 match frames passed (more than the 2-frame buffer). The RC buttons themselves start nothing.
setup: module meter 5000 0 0 0 10000 0
setup: module roman_cancel 112 3 3 5000 15 6 40 1 2
setup: p1 character testman
setup: p2 character testman
setup: p1 x = -30000
setup: p2 x = 30000
frame 1: p1 5a
frame 6: p1 5a+b+c
frame 8: p1 5b

frame 5: expect p1 event hit
frame 6: expect p1 event module
frames 6-10: expect freeze > 0
frame 12: expect p1 move = 5b
frame 12: expect p1 move_frame = 1
